        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 2043-US32D, Sectional Stainless Steel Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sectional Stainless Steel Lever Mortise Lockset is constructed from 304 Stainless Steel with a brushed finish.  Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. The Contemporary Mortise Lockset has a very sleek design that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. Choose from a several lockable functions including single cylinder and double cylinder entrysets.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sectional Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 2043 Sectional Stainless Steel Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
